.6,"pb_forward":4.1,"div_yield":0.91,"ps_ratio":4.8,"fcf_to_ev":3.63,"fcf_to_mcap":5.16,"liab_to_assets":72.1,"cash_to_assets":1,"current_ratio":0.75,"roe":16.5,"roa":4.6,"moat":{"ticker":"SGI","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SGI 在家具和家電領域擁有一定的品牌知名度，但其品牌定價權相對有限。雖然部分高端產品線能享有溢價，但整體市場競爭激烈，消費者對價格敏感度較高。公司需要持續投入品牌建設和產品創新，以鞏固和提升其定價能力。與頂級奢侈品牌相比，SGI 的品牌護城河尚不夠深厚，難以完全抵禦價格戰或替代品的衝擊。","comment_en":"SGI possesses some brand recognition in the furnishings and appliances sector, but its pricing power is relatively limited. While certain premium product lines can command higher prices, the market is highly competitive, and consumers are price-sensitive. The company needs continuous investment in brand building and product innovation to strengthen its pricing ability. Compared to top luxury brands, SGI's brand moat is not deep enough to fully withstand price wars or substitutes."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"SGI 所處的家具和家電行業，專利和監管壁壘相對較低。雖然公司可能擁有某些產品設計或製造工藝的專利，但這些專利通常難以形成持久的、廣泛的競爭優勢。行業的技術迭代速度快，模仿成本不高，監管政策對市場格局的影響也有限。因此，在專利和監管方面，SGI 的護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"The furnishings and appliances industry, where SGI operates, has relatively low barriers related to patents and regulations. While the company may hold patents for certain product designs or manufacturing processes, these typically do not form a lasting, broad competitive advantage. The industry experiences rapid technological iteration, with low imitation costs, and regulatory policies have limited impact on market structure. Consequently, SGI's moat in patents and regulatory aspects is very weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"SGI 的產品轉換成本不高。對於大多數消費者而言，更換家具或家電產品並不需要付出高昂的時間、金錢或學習成本。一旦消費者選擇了其他品牌，重新適應的難度也較小。雖然 SGI 努力透過設計和品質吸引客戶，但這種客戶忠誠度並非由高轉換成本所驅動，因此這方面的護城河較為平庸。","comment_en":"The switching costs for SGI's products are not high. For most consumers, replacing furniture or appliances does not involve significant time, financial, or learning costs. Once a consumer chooses another brand, the difficulty of adapting is minimal. While SGI strives to attract customers through design and quality, this customer loyalty is not driven by high switching costs, making the moat in this area mediocre."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"SGI 的業務模式幾乎不存在網絡效應。其產品的銷售和使用，並不會因為更多用戶的加入而產生價值遞增。公司與客戶之間的互動是單向的交易，而非形成一個相互依賴、價值共創的生態系統。在這種情況下，網絡效應無法為 SGI 提供任何競爭優勢或護城河。","comment_en":"SGI's business model exhibits virtually no network effects. The sale and use of its products do not generate increasing value with the addition of more users. The interaction between the company and its customers is a one-way transaction, rather than forming an interdependent ecosystem for co-creating value. In this scenario, network effects cannot provide SGI with any competitive advantage or moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SGI 作為一家規模較大的家具和家電製造商，在採購、生產和分銷方面享有一定的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的採購量有助於降低原材料成本，優化的生產流程和自動化設備能提升效率，廣泛的分銷網絡則能降低物流成本。這種成本優勢使其在價格競爭中具有一定的靈活性，並能為公司提供穩定的利潤空間。","comment_en":"As a relatively large manufacturer of furnishings and appliances, SGI benefits from certain economies of scale in procurement, production, and distribution. Its substantial purchasing volume helps reduce raw material costs, optimized production processes and automated equipment enhance efficiency, and an extensive distribution network lowers logistics expenses. This cost advantage provides flexibility in price competition and offers stable profit margins."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"SGI 的業務主要集中在標準化的家具和家電製造與銷售，缺乏獨特的地理位置或資產壁壘。其生產基地和銷售網絡相對容易被競爭對手複製。公司並未依賴於任何特定的、難以替代的地理資源或位置優勢來獲取競爭力。因此，在這一維度上，SGI 的護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"SGI's business primarily focuses on standardized manufacturing and sales of furnishings and appliances, lacking unique geographical or asset-based barriers. Its production bases and sales networks are relatively easy for competitors to replicate. The company does not rely on any specific, irreplaceable geographical resources or location advantages for its competitiveness. Therefore, SGI's moat in this dimension is very weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"SGI 在營運效率方面表現尚可，透過精實生產、供應鏈管理和流程優化，努力降低成本並提高生產力。其 F-Score 為 5/9，顯示在盈利能力、槓桿、流動性、獲利能力和營運效率等方面有中等水平的表現。然而，與行業內頂尖的營運效率標竿相比，SGI 仍有提升空間，其效率優勢並非壓倒性的護城河。","comment_en":"SGI demonstrates moderate operational efficiency, striving to reduce costs and increase productivity through lean manufacturing, supply chain management, and process optimization. Its F-Score of 5/9 indicates a mid-level performance in profitability, leverage, liquidity, profitability, and operational efficiency. However, compared to the top operational efficiency benchmarks in the industry, SGI still has room for improvement, and its efficiency advantage does not constitute an overwhelming moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SGI 的資本配置能力表現穩健。公司在維持適度負債水平的同時，能夠產生穩定的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $769.0M），並將其用於股東回報（如股息或股票回購）和再投資。其 ROE 達 16.5%，顯示資本運用效率良好。管理層似乎能夠在維持業務增長和回報股東之間取得平衡，展現出一定的資本配置智慧。","comment_en":"SGI's capital allocation capabilities are solid. While maintaining a moderate debt level, the company generates stable free cash flow (FCF TTM: $769.0M), which is used for shareholder returns (dividends or buybacks) and reinvestment. Its ROE of 16.5% indicates good capital utilization efficiency. Management appears capable of balancing business growth with shareholder returns, demonstrating a degree of capital allocation acumen."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"SGI 的客戶留存率處於中等水平。雖然其產品的品質和設計能夠吸引部分回頭客，但家具和家電的購買週期較長，且市場上存在眾多替代選擇。公司透過客戶服務和產品的耐用性來維繫客戶關係，但缺乏像訂閱制或高度個性化服務那樣能鎖定客戶的機制。因此，客戶忠誠度並非由極高的留存壁壘所支撐。","comment_en":"SGI's customer retention rate is moderate. While its product quality and design attract some repeat customers, the purchase cycle for furniture and appliances is long, and numerous alternatives exist in the market. The company maintains customer relationships through customer service and product durability, but lacks mechanisms like subscriptions or highly personalized services that lock in customers. Consequently, customer loyalty is not supported by extremely high retention barriers."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"SGI 的產品具有一定的耐用性，特別是其核心的家具和家電產品，通常能夠使用多年。然而，這更多是產品本身的物理屬性，而非公司業務模式的持久性。行業的快速變化、消費者偏好的轉移以及新技術的出現，都可能對其產品的長期市場接受度構成挑戰。因此，其業務的長期持久性面臨一定的外部風險。","comment_en":"SGI's products possess a degree of durability, especially its core furniture and appliance offerings, which typically last for many years. However, this is more a function of the physical attributes of the products themselves rather than the durability of the company's business model. Rapid industry changes, shifting consumer preferences, and the emergence of new technologies can challenge the long-term market acceptance of its products. Therefore, the long-term durability of its business faces certain external risks."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Somnigroup International Inc (SGI) 在家具和家電行業中，展現出一個以規模成本和穩健資本配置為主要支撐的經濟護城河。其規模優勢帶來了採購和生產上的成本效益，而管理層在資本配置上的審慎態度，則確保了公司能夠產生穩定的自由現金流並回報股東。然而，SGI 在品牌定價權、專利監管、網絡效應和轉換成本等方面則相對薄弱，這些因素限制了其護城河的深度和廣度。整體而言，SGI 的護城河更接近於一個具有成本優勢的製造商，而非擁有強大特許經營權或網絡效應的企業。其業務模式的持久性有待觀察，尤其是在面對快速變化的市場和技術時。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Somnigroup International Inc (SGI) operates within the furnishings and appliances sector, exhibiting an economic moat primarily supported by cost advantages from scale and solid capital allocation. Its scale provides procurement and production efficiencies, while management's prudent approach to capital allocation ensures stable free cash flow generation and shareholder returns. However, SGI shows relative weakness in brand pricing power, patent/regulatory barriers, network effects, and switching costs, limiting the depth and breadth of its moat. Overall, SGI's moat resembles that of a cost-advantaged manufacturer rather than a business with strong franchise value or network effects. The long-term durability of its business model remains to be seen, especially in the face of a rapidly evolving market and technology.","evidenceHash":"f1a80c3a75aa9d8035bb8276e842c17cd2ba31a2062e197987f1c2845c465f9d","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"5617acfbafdfc92e34d630ae790399d5febefb4642e64c979e64a04a0a1a505b"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"5617acfbafdfc92e34d630ae790399d5febefb4642e64c979e64a04a0a1a505b"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SGI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SGI.png","website":"https://somnigroup.com","ceo":"Scott L. Thompson","full_time_employees":"19000","description":"Somnigroup International Inc., operating as Somni, leads the field in advanced sleep technology and holistic wellness solutions. They engineer groundbreaking products specifically designed to elevate sleep quality. Their approach seamlessly integrates scientifically validated methods, intelligent technology, and data-driven insights to optimize sleep patterns and foster overall well-being.","description_en":"Somnigroup International Inc., operating as Somni, leads the field in advanced sleep technology and holistic wellness solutions. They engineer groundbreaking products specifically designed to elevate sleep quality. Their approach seamlessly integrates scientifically validated methods, intelligent technology, and data-driven insights to optimize sleep patterns and foster overall well-being.","description_zh":"**Somnigroup International Inc. (SGI) 業務營運概述**\n\nSomnigroup International Inc. (SGI)，以「Somni」品牌營運，為先進睡眠科技與全方位健康解決方案的領導者。公司專注於研發創新性產品，旨在顯著提升睡眠品質。\n\nSGI 的核心業務聚焦於透過整合科學驗證方法、智慧科技及數據驅動洞察，優化睡眠模式並促進整體身心健康。其營運模式結合了產品開發、技術創新與個人化健康管理服務。\n\n關鍵技術包括但不限於：運用生物感測器與演算法分析睡眠數據，提供精準的睡眠階段識別與品質評估；開發具備智慧調節功能的睡眠輔助裝置，例如可調式床墊、智慧燈光系統及音頻療法設備，以適應個人睡眠需求。\n\n透過數據分析平台，SGI 能夠為使用者提供個人化的睡眠改善建議與健康指導，形成一個閉環的健康管理生態系統。其產品與服務旨在解決現代人普遍面臨的睡眠障礙問題，並將睡眠品質提升視為整體健康福祉的基石。","address":"1000 Tempur Way","city":"Dallas","state":"TX","zip":"75201","country":"US","phone":"800 878 8889","full_address":"1000 Tempur Way, Dallas, TX 75201, US","range_52w":"60.08-98.56","year_high":98.56,"year_low":60.08,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":60.08,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":10825,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":10825,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":9222,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":9221,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8978,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":6148,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":4992,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"HAGALE JAMES TYSON","title":"officer: President - Leggett & Platt","is_buy":null,"action":"A